{"type":"message","id":"13510fd1","parentId":"987f04d0","timestamp":"2026-04-08T17:54:10.364Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## 🎯 **我的建议**\n\n如果你**只需要查询**，我建议：\n\n### **方案A：使用现有工具**\n直接用curl命令查询，不需要安装技能：\n```bash\n# 简单价格查询\ncurl -s \"https://api.binance.com/api/v3/ticker/price?symbol=BTCUSDT\"\n\n# 多个币种价格\ncurl -s \"https://api.binance.com/api/v3/ticker/price\" | jq '.[] | select(.symbol | endswith(\"USDT\")) | .symbol + \": \" + .price' | head -20\n```\n\n### **方案B：安装轻量级查询技能**\n安装 `crypto-price-by-lpdawn` 或类似的纯查询技能。\n\n### **方案C：自定义简单查询脚本**\n我可以帮你写一个简单的shell脚本，放在你的workspace里：\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# binance-query.sh\nSYMBOL=${1:-BTCUSDT}\ncurl -s \"https://api.binence.com/api/v3/ticker/price?symbol=$SYMBOL\" | jq -r '.symbol + \" 价格: $\" + .price'\n```\n\n**你想选择哪个方案？**\n\n或者如果你有特定的查询需求（比如监控某些币种、获取特定时间段的K线等），告诉我，我可以帮你定制一个解决方案。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"deepseek-v3.2","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775670837395,"responseId":"0217756708374891c239b210ad979e2a15a147bceeac3acc2e3da"}}
