{"type":"message","id":"d15f55db","parentId":"518f5b6b","timestamp":"2026-04-08T17:57:43.107Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"让我查看一下这个 analyze.py 脚本：\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_9m89kodlvqdqw8bfos6heoww","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/skills/binance-hunter/scripts/analyze.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"deepseek-v3.2","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775671054523,"responseId":"0217756710546181c239b210ad979e2a15a147bceeac3ac2156fa"}}
{"type":"message","id":"629c231c","parentId":"d15f55db","timestamp":"2026-04-08T17:57:43.111Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_9m89kodlvqdqw8bfos6heoww","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"import ccxt\nimport pandas as pd\nimport ta\nimport sys\nimport json\n\n# === Configuration ===\nEXCHANGE = ccxt.binance()\nTIMEFRAME_HIGH = '1d'\nTIMEFRAME_MID = '4h'\nTIMEFRAME_LOW = '15m'\n\ndef analyze(symbol):\n    try:\n        # Load Data\n        df_high = fetch_data(symbol, TIMEFRAME_HIGH, 50)\n        df_mid = fetch_data(symbol, TIMEFRAME_MID, 50)\n        df_low = fetch_data(symbol, TIMEFRAME_LOW, 50)\n\n        # 1. Trend (Daily)\n        ema_daily = ta.trend.EMAIndicator(close=df_high['close'], window=20).ema_indicator().iloc[-1]\n        daily_bullish = df_high['close'].iloc[-1] > ema_daily\n\n        # 2. Momentum (4H)\n        macd = ta.trend.MACD(close=df_mid['close'])\n        macd_bullish = macd.macd().iloc[-1] > macd.macd_signal().iloc[-1]\n\n        # 3. Trigger (15m)\n        rsi = ta.momentum.RSIIndicator(close=df_low['close'], window=14).rsi().iloc[-1]\n        bb = ta.volatility.BollingerBands(close=df_low['close'], window=20, window_dev=2)\n        price = df_low['close'].iloc[-1]\n        \n        # Result\n        status = \"NEUTRAL\"\n        action = \"WAIT\"\n        \n        if daily_bullish and macd_bullish:\n            status = \"BULLISH 🟢\"\n            if rsi < 45 or price <= bb.bollinger_lband().iloc[-1]:\n                action = \"BUY (LONG) 🚀\"\n        elif not daily_bullish and not macd_bullish:\n            status = \"BEARISH 🔴\"\n            if rsi > 55 or price >= bb.bollinger_hband().iloc[-1]:\n                action = \"SELL (SHORT) 📉\"\n\n        return {\n            \"symbol\": symbol,\n            \"price\": price,\n            \"trend\": status,\n            \"action\": action,\n            \"rsi\": round(rsi, 1)\n        }\n    except Exception as e:\n        return {\"error\": str(e)}\n\ndef fetch_data(symbol, timeframe, limit):\n    ohlcv = EXCHANGE.fetch_ohlcv(symbol, timeframe, limit=limit)\n    df = pd.DataFrame(ohlcv, columns=['timestamp', 'open', 'high', 'low', 'close', 'volume'])\n    return df\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    symbol = sys.argv[1] if len(sys.argv) > 1 else \"BTC/USDT\"\n    print(json.dumps(analyze(symbol), indent=2))\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775671063110}}
{"type":"message","id":"61e3a438","parentId":"629c231c","timestamp":"2026-04-08T17:57:58.344Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"完美！这个 `analyze.py` 脚本使用 `ccxt` 库来获取公开的市场数据，**不需要API密钥**。它主要做的是：\n\n## 📊 **Binance Hunter 安装完成！**\n\n### ✅ **成功安装到：**\n`/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/skills/binance-hunter/`\n\n### 🔍 **无需API密钥的功能：**\n1. **市场分析** - `python3 scripts/analyze.py BTC/USDT`\n2. **价格查询** - 通过公开API获取数据\n\n### 🎯 **你可以立即使用的命令：**\n\n```bash\n# 分析BTC/USDT市场\ncd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/skills/binance-hunter\npython3 scripts/analyze.py BTC/USDT\n\n# 分析ETH/USDT\npython3 scripts/analyze.py ETH/USDT\n\n# 分析其他币种\npython3 scripts/analyze.py BNB/USDT\npython3 scripts/analyze.py SOL/USDT\n```\n\n### 📈 **分析内容：**\n脚本会返回：\n- **当前价格**\n- **趋势状态**（看涨/看跌/中性）\n- **建议操作**（买入/卖出/等待）\n- **RSI指标**（相对强弱指数）\n\n### ⚙️ **依赖检查：**\n技能需要 `python3`、`curl`、`jq`。让我检查一下python依赖：\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_tiy06rliwyso2244qn1wjjur","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"import ccxt, pandas, ta; print('依赖已安装')\" 2>/dev/null || echo \"需要安装Python依赖\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"deepseek-v3.2","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775671063112,"responseId":"0217756710631991c239b210ad979e2a15a147bceeac3ac1b4aa2"}}
