{"type":"message","id":"0260a219","parentId":"a49229ae","timestamp":"2026-04-08T17:58:49.247Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"看起来当前的执行环境权限有限。不过技能已经安装好了，你可以：\n\n## 🎯 **使用建议**\n\n### **方案1：在权限充足的环境中使用**\n在你的本地机器或服务器上：\n```bash\n# 1. 安装依赖\npip3 install ccxt pandas ta\n\n# 2. 安装jq\nsudo apt-get install jq\n\n# 3. 使用技能\npython3 scripts/analyze.py BTC/USDT\n```\n\n### **方案2：使用纯curl查询（最简单）**\n```bash\n# 获取BTC价格\ncurl -s \"https://api.binance.com/api/v3/ticker/price?symbol=BTCUSDT\"\n\n# 获取ETH价格\ncurl -s \"https://api.binance.com/api/v3/ticker/price?symbol=ETHUSDT\"\n```\n\n### **方案3：我可以为你创建简化脚本**\n创建一个不需要特殊依赖的脚本：\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# simple-binance-query.sh\nSYMBOL=${1:-BTCUSDT}\nURL=\"https://api.binance.com/api/v3/ticker/price?symbol=$SYMBOL\"\ncurl -s \"$URL\"\n```\n\n**你想选择哪个方案？或者需要我帮你创建一些简单的查询工具吗？**"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"deepseek-v3.2","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775671118336,"responseId":"0217756711184211c239b210ad979e2a15a147bceeac3ac9f66bc"}}
